    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "当采用 u(t) = -K x_hat(t)（其中 K 通过状态反馈设计，x_hat 取自观测器）时，全系统是稳定的，因为系统特征方程可分解为状态反馈特征方程与观测器特征方程的乘积。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "When using u(t) = -K x_hat(t) with K designed via state feedback and x_hat from the observer, the overall system is stable because the characteristic equation factors into the product of the state feedback and observer characteristic equations.",
